    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but when you say \"let the burden go\" and \"finding peace\"... it doesn't feel like talking about feeling better. it feels like talking about just... not being a person anymore. like, if the only way to stop being a parasite is to just not exist, isn't that the only logical thing left to do?",
